{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Beanie is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It requires ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and either an ",["l","橡子","Acorn"],", ",["l","桃花心木种子","Mahogany Seed"],", ",["l","枫树种子","Maple Seed"],", or ",["l","松果","Pine Cone"],". It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". Male players have a ≈2% chance to receive the outfit with the Beanie."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Beanie outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt004.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Skull Shirt"]," and ",["f","Farmer_Pants.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Farmer Pants"]," (dyed RGB value 40,40,40)."]]]]]]]}